<style>
  .panel-root {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 92px;
    background-color: #10151f;
    border-radius: 3.2px;
    border-width: 0.4px;
    border-color: #2a3550;
  }

  .panel-content {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.8px;
    padding: 4.0px;
    background-color: #10151f;
    border-radius: 3.2px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #f5d90a;
    font-size: 2.7px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  }

  .heading {
    color: #fafaf7;
    font-size: 5.4px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .sub {
    color: #9aa4b8;
    font-size: 2.9px;
  }

  .stats {
    color: #e8ecf4;
    font-size: 3.4px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .gold {
    color: #ffd76a;
    font-size: 3.6px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .quest {
    color: #b9c4d8;
    font-size: 2.9px;
  }

  .feed {
    color: #8fb8d8;
    font-size: 2.7px;
  }

  .intro-wrap {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.8px;
  }

  .story {
    color: #d8cfe0;
    font-size: 2.9px;
  }

  .hint {
    color: #8fb8d8;
    font-size: 2.5px;
  }

  .btn-begin {
    background-color: #2d4a35;
    border-color: #4a7a55;
  }

  .race-wrap {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4px;
  }

  .game-wrap {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.1px;
  }

  .btn {
    background-color: #232b3d;
    border-radius: 2.2px;
    border-width: 0.2px;
    border-color: #3a4763;
    height: 8.1px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn-sm {
    background-color: #232b3d;
    border-radius: 2.2px;
    border-width: 0.2px;
    border-color: #3a4763;
    height: 8.1px;
    flex-grow: 1;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn-label {
    font-size: 2.9px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .divider {
    height: 0.2px;
    background-color: #2a3550;
    margin-top: 0.9px;
    margin-bottom: 0.9px;
  }

  .row {
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 0.9px;
  }

  .edit-wrap {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9px;
  }

  .xrb {
    margin-left: 4.0px;
    margin-right: 4.0px;
    margin-bottom: 3.2px;
    height: 9.0px;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
<Panel class="panel-root">
  <div class="panel-content">
    <div class="eyebrow">ATLAS ETERNAL</div>
    <div class="heading">The Living Map</div>
    <div class="sub">Carry your champion. Dig the X. Rise to SSSS.</div>
    <div id="intro-wrap" class="intro-wrap">
      <div class="story">Long ago the world was folded into one living map. Its ink still moves - seas breathe, forests creep, mountains wake.</div>
      <div id="intro-map-story" class="story">You are the last Cartographer's heir. Carry your meeple across the tiles, dig where the red X burns, and climb from rank F to SSSS.</div>
      <div class="hint">HOW TO PLAY - pinch the blue meeple and drop it on a tile to travel beyond the edge of the map. Press glowing things. Accept quest cards for riches.</div>
      <Button id="btn-begin" class="btn btn-begin"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Begin the Crossing</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
    <div id="race-wrap" class="race-wrap" style="display: none">
      <div class="sub">Bind your soul - pick a race:</div>
      <Button id="btn-race-0" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Human</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-race-1" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Dwarf</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-race-2" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Elf</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-race-3" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Naga</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-race-4" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Demon</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
    <div id="game-wrap" class="game-wrap" style="display: none">
      <div id="stat-race" class="stats">-</div>
      <div id="stat-power" class="stats">Power 0</div>
      <div id="stat-gold" class="gold">0 gold</div>
      <div id="stat-haven" class="sub">Haven: unbuilt</div>
      <div id="stat-map" class="sub">Map: the Wild Ink</div>
      <div id="stat-peers" class="sub">Table: solo</div>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <Button id="btn-home" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Return to Haven</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-map" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Next Expedition</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-new" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">New Journey</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-edit" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Cartographer Mode</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <div id="login-wrap" class="edit-wrap" style="display: none">
        <div class="sub">CARTOGRAPHER LOGIN - tap your key:</div>
        <div id="login-status" class="feed">First login claims a new key (4+ digits).</div>
        <div id="pin-display" class="stats">[    ]</div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="pin-1" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">1</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="pin-2" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">2</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="pin-3" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">3</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="pin-4" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">4</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="pin-5" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">5</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="pin-6" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">6</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="pin-7" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">7</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="pin-8" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">8</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="pin-9" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">9</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="pin-0" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">0</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="pin-back" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Back</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="pin-clear" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Clear</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="pin-enter" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Enter</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="edit-wrap" class="edit-wrap" style="display: none">
        <div class="sub">WORLD TOOLS - carry meeple, then stamp:</div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="tool-o" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Sea</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="tool-s" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Sand</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="tool-d" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Dsrt</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="tool-g" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Gras</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="tool-f" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Frst</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="tool-r" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Rock</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="tool-n" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Snow</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="tool-road" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Road</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="tool-dig" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Dig X</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="tool-haven" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Haven</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="tool-champ" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Spawn</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="tool-erase" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Erase</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="btn-brush-minus" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">-</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <div id="brush-label" class="sub">Brush 1</div>
          <Button id="btn-brush-plus" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">+</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="sub">BUILD BLOCKS - minecraft style:</div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="mat-d" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Dirt</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-s" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Stone</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-w" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Wood</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-b" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Brick</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="mat-g" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Glass</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-o" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Gold</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-l" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Leaf</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <div id="mat-label" class="sub">Stone</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="mat-c" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Concr</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-m" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Marbl</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-i" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Iron</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-k" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Obsid</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="mat-a" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Water</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-v" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Lava</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-t" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Torch</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="sub">PIECES - walls doors &amp; more:</div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="mat-W" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Wall</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-D" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Door</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-S" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Stair</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-F" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Fence</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="mat-P" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Pane</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="mat-R" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Roof</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="btn-vox-add" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Place Block</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="btn-vox-del" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Break Block</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="btn-vox-clear" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Clear</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <Button id="btn-export" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Export Map JSON</ButtonLabel></Button>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="btn-set-home" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Set as Home Map</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="btn-clear-home" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Reset Default</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div id="home-status" class="feed">Your map becomes the world everyone lands in.</div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="btn-signout" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Sign out</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="sub">AVATAR - your champion:</div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="char-c-0" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Az</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="char-c-1" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Em</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="char-c-2" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Vd</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="char-c-3" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Ro</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="char-c-4" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Cr</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="char-c-5" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Gd</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <Button id="hat-0" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Bare</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="hat-1" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Cap</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="hat-2" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Horns</ButtonLabel></Button>
          <Button id="hat-3" class="btn-sm"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Crown</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="sub">QUEST RAIL</div>
      <div id="quest-0" class="quest"></div>
      <div id="quest-1" class="quest"></div>
      <div id="quest-2" class="quest"></div>
      <div id="quest-3" class="quest"></div>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div id="feed-0" class="feed"></div>
      <div id="feed-1" class="feed"></div>
      <div id="feed-2" class="feed"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Button id="xr-button" class="xrb"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Enter XR</ButtonLabel></Button>
  <Button id="exit-button" class="xrb" style="display: none"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Exit to Browser</ButtonLabel></Button>
</Panel>
